  "grammar_explanations": [
    {
      "slug": "present simple: review (be, have got, common verbs)",
      "title_form": "Repaso del presente simple: be, have got y verbos comunes",
      "title_target": "Present Simple Review: be, have got, and Common Verbs",
      "description_md_form": "En esta lección repasamos el **presente simple** para hablar de ti mismo. Usamos **be** para describir (nombre, edad, origen) y **have got** para hablar de posesiones o familia. También usamos **verbos comunes** como *work* o *live* para hablar de tu vida diaria.\n\n**Estructura básica:**\n- **be**: `I am`, `you are`, `he/she/it is`.\n- **have got**: `I have got`, `you have got`, `he/she/it has got`.\n- **Verbos comunes**: `I work`, `I live`, `I speak`.\n\n**Negativo:**\n- **be**: `I am not`, `you are not`.\n- **have got**: `I have not got`.\n- **Verbos**: `I do not work`.\n\n**Preguntas:**\n- **be**: `Are you...?`\n- **have got**: `Have you got...?`\n- **Verbos**: `Do you work...?`",
      "description_md_target": "In this lesson we review the **present simple** to talk about yourself. We use **be** to describe (name, age, origin) and **have got** to talk about possessions or family. We also use **common verbs** like *work* or *live* to talk about your daily life.\n\n**Basic structure:**\n- **be**: `I am`, `you are`, `he/she/it is`.\n- **have got**: `I have got`, `you have got`, `he/she/it has got`.\n- **Common verbs**: `I work`, `I live`, `I speak`.\n\n**Negative:**\n- **be**: `I am not`, `you are not`.\n- **have got**: `I have not got`.\n- **Verbs**: `I do not work`.\n\n**Questions:**\n- **be**: `Are you...?`\n- **have got**: `Have you got...?`\n- **Verbs**: `Do you work...?`",
      "grammar_structure": "Subject + (be / have got / common verb) + complement",
      "conjugation_table": {
        "name": "present_simple_review",
        "headers": [
          "Pronombre",
          "be",
          "have got",
          "Verbo común"
        ],
